# Secret group `gateway-token`: The bearer token every caller of the gateway's /internal/* routes presents.
# Loaded by: semprec-api.service, semprec-agents.service, semprec-transcribe.service, semprec-ai-gateway.service.
#
# Ownership and mode are load-bearing: `root:root 0600`. systemd reads EnvironmentFile= as root
# before dropping privileges. provision.sh installs this template to
# /opt/semprec/shared/env/gateway-token.env only when that file does not exist, so an operator's values are
# never overwritten by a rerun, and it never prints a value. A key belongs to exactly one group
# (docs/adr/2026-10-03-per-service-secret-groups.md); this file is excluded from restic backups.

# AI_GATEWAY_INTERNAL_TOKEN: shared between semprec-api, semprec-agents (its pi session, over
# POST /internal/pi/messages) and semprec-ai-gateway — every process that calls the gateway's
# /internal/* routes must present this exact value as its Bearer token. Generate
# with: openssl rand -hex 32
AI_GATEWAY_INTERNAL_TOKEN=
